{"text": "The recognition of burnout as an occupational phenomenon by the W H O in 2019 marked an important moment in the discourse on workplace mental health. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This designation reframes clinical assessment and organizational responsibility, shifting attention to systemic prevention. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It invites employers to adopt structural interventions rather than relying solely on individual level remedies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In practice, this means clinicians should collaborate with occupational health and leadership to address root causes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It signaled a shift away from viewing burnout as a personal failing or a matter of individual resilience, toward understanding it as a structural issue rooted in organizational culture, leadership practices, and the broader socio economic context of work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This reframing is essential, as it opens the door to systemic interventions and policy level changes rather than placing the burden solely on individuals to cope or adapt.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "g", "n", "i", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "b", "u", "r", "n", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", "s", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "c", "c", "u", "p", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", "a", "l", " ", "p", "h", "e", "n", "o", "m", "e", "n", "o", "n", " ", "b", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "W", " ", "H", " ", "O", " ", "i", "n", " ", "2", "0", "1", "9", " ", "m", "a", "r", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", " ", "i", "m", "p", "o", "r", "t", "a", "n", "t", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "s", "c", "o", "u", "r", "s", "e", " ", "o", "n", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", " ", "m", "e", "n", "t", "a", "l", " ", "h", "e", "a", "l", "t", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "d", "e", "s", "i", 